{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"b34bf3a3-59fc-4f1a-bb52-93c7575e7874","step_index":23,"state":"DONE","step_type":"agent_response","text_delta":"{\"analysisFile\":\"audit-context/functions/11-onERC721Received.md\",\"assumptions\":[{\"claim\":\"The Raffle clone has been initialized prior to onERC721Received so that prizeToken and sponsor are non-zero addresses and status is Status.AwaitingPrize (whereas the implementation contract is locked in Status.Refunding).\",\"establishedBy\":\"Raffle.initialize (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L176-L206), Raffle.constructor (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L164-L165), and RaffleFactory.createRaffle (packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:L106-L128)\"},{\"claim\":\"Calling contract msg.sender (prizeToken) only invokes onERC721Received(factory, sponsor, prizeTokenId, ...) during a genuine transfer that vests ownership of prizeTokenId in the Raffle clone.\",\"establishedBy\":\"RaffleFactory.createRaffle checks prize.ownerOf(params.prizeTokenId) == raffle and IRaffle(raffle).status() == IRaffle.Status.Active immediately after prize.safeTransferFrom (packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:L128-L134) and checks IERC165.supportsInterface(type(IERC721).interfaceId) (packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:L171-L177); ongoing standards-compliant ERC-721 custody behavior of the arbitrary prizeToken contract is established by nothing found\"},{\"claim\":\"prizeToken.safeTransferFrom invokes IERC721Receiver.onERC721Received directly without requiring IERC165.supportsInterface(type(IERC721Receiver).interfaceId) to return true on the Raffle clone (ERC721.supportsInterface at packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L45-L50 does not include IERC721Receiver).\",\"establishedBy\":\"nothing found\"}],\"callers\":[\"RaffleFactory.createRaffle via IERC721(params.prizeToken).safeTransferFrom (packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:L128) -\\u003e ERC721.safeTransferFrom (packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol:L128-L136) -\\u003e ERC721Utils.checkOnERC721Received (packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/utils/ERC721Utils.sol:L33)\",\"Any external caller or ERC-721 contract directly via the external entrypoint (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L416-L419)\"],\"calls\":[],\"file\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"function\":\"onERC721Received\",\"invariants\":[{\"claim\":\"onERC721Received reverts with UnexpectedPrize unless status == Status.AwaitingPrize, msg.sender == address(prizeToken), tokenId == prizeTokenId, from == sponsor, and operator == factory.\",\"evidence\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L421-L426\"},{\"claim\":\"On success, status transitions from Status.AwaitingPrize to Status.Active, PrizeDeposited(msg.sender, tokenId, from) is emitted, and IERC721Receiver.onERC721Received.selector (0x150b7a02) is returned.\",\"evidence\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L428-L430\"},{\"claim\":\"onERC721Received can succeed at most once per Raffle clone because it transitions status to Status.Active and no function ever sets status back to Status.AwaitingPrize after one-time initialization.\",\"evidence\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L164-L165, L177, L205, L252, L299, L422, L428, L521\"}],\"lines\":\"L416-L431\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"sharedState\":[\"status (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L124)\",\"prizeToken (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L70)\",\"prizeTokenId (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L73)\",\"sponsor (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L61)\",\"factory (packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:L55)\"]}\n","duration_seconds":14.944821,"usage":{"input_tokens":10740,"output_tokens":1348,"thinking_tokens":264,"cache_read_tokens":55255,"total_tokens":12088}}}
